{
  "id": "reduckShopAlertWatch",
  "name": "Shop alert and watch, to your cart (Reduck)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shop alert and watch, to your cart, with Reduck\n\nTwo things start this workflow, and both lead to the same checks:\n\n- **An alert**: a message that reaches the webhook (for example from a bot that forwards a chat channel) and holds a product link.\n- **The watch**: every few minutes, the workflow reads one listing page of the shop and compares it with the last time. A product that is new, or back in stock, goes on.\n\nFor each product, the Reduck node runs `reduck/king-jouet.com/get_product` to read its price and stock. When the price is under your limit and the page offers the product, it runs `reduck/king-jouet.com/add_to_cart`, then posts the result to your notification webhook. Otherwise it posts that it needs you.\n\nThe Reduck node works in your own Chrome, so the shop sees a normal visitor. Nothing is paid: you finish the order yourself. For a shop where a script can place the order, see the example **Alert to automatic purchase**.\n\nThe first watch run only records what the shop shows. n8n keeps that memory only for the **active** workflow: activate it, do not just test it.\n\nTo use another shop, change the script addresses and arguments, and the **Product link pattern** in **Config**.\n\nBefore you activate it: set the **Config** values, a **Header Auth** credential on the webhook, and keep **Retry On Fail** off on **Add To Cart**.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "cd14e417-18f0-5424-8096-413881bfd569",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "shop-alert",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9bf7bccc-73eb-50ef-8055-af750d92e0f9",
      "name": "Alert Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ],
      "webhookId": "ddff62a1-a31b-5e7e-aec4-8cbb3a6746f2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a70c4c85-9862-55c7-b7b3-b646c8eea1d2",
      "name": "Trigger Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "listing_url",
              "name": "listing_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.king-jouet.com/jeux-jouets/jeux-societes/page1.htm"
            },
            {
              "id": "product_pattern",
              "name": "product_pattern",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https?://(?:www\\.)?king-jouet\\.com/[^\\s>)]*ref-\\d+-[^\\s>)]*"
            },
            {
              "id": "max_price",
              "name": "max_price",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "quantity",
              "name": "quantity",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "notify_webhook",
              "name": "notify_webhook",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a426f55a-16bf-5460-861c-6a217b78c52a",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cf8eac50-72f0-57ff-9093-733905dbf505",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Alert Webhook').isExecuted }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "84696845-8b58-576f-b4f3-a16b4d3022b9",
      "name": "From An Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Takes the product link out of the alert text with the Config pattern. No link: the run stops here.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst text = $('Alert Webhook').first().json.body?.content ?? '';\nconst m = text.match(new RegExp(cfg.product_pattern, 'i'));\nif (!m) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { url: m[0], source: 'alert' } }];"
      },
      "id": "68a22c36-aeff-58d9-992b-8962e035fd81",
      "name": "Read Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "script": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "address",
          "value": "reduck/king-jouet.com/list_products"
        },
        "args": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "url": "={{ $json.listing_url }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "url",
              "displayName": "url",
              "required": true,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            },
            {
              "id": "page",
              "displayName": "page",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "number",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "browser": "extension",
        "deviceId": "extension",
        "simplify": true
      },
      "id": "3f75fc0d-7417-5bcc-be23-52fa7aa2ee85",
      "name": "List Products",
      "type": "@reduck-ai/n8n-nodes-reduck.reduck",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        160
      ],
      "credentials": {},
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Compares the listing with the one seen last time. New products, and products back on the web site, go on.\nconst res = $input.first().json.result;\nif (!res || !Array.isArray(res.products)) throw new Error('The listing could not be read: ' + ($input.first().json.error ?? 'no result'));\nconst memory = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst before = memory.seen ?? null;\nconst now = {};\nfor (const p of res.products) now[p.ref] = p.available_web;\nmemory.seen = now;\nif (before === null) return []; // first run: only remember\nconst changed = res.products.filter((p) => p.available_web && (before[p.ref] === undefined || before[p.ref] === false));\nreturn changed.map((p) => ({ json: { url: p.url, source: before[p.ref] === undefined ? 'new product' : 'back in stock' } }));"
      },
      "id": "595e7915-1c24-58af-82db-c1e4d71342b9",
      "name": "Find What Changed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        160
      ]
    },
